		IL_006a: newobj instance void class [mscorlib]System.Func`2<class [DigisatServer.Application.Main.Dto]DigisatServer.Application.Main.Dto.Compras.Cotacoes.ItemCotacaoDto, class '<>f__AnonymousType1`9'<string, string, string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal, string, string, string, class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.List`1<class '<>f__AnonymousType2`3'<string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal>>>>::.ctor(object, native int) /* 0A0002B0 */
		IL_006f: call class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1<!!1> [System.Core]System.Linq.Enumerable::Select<class [DigisatServer.Application.Main.Dto]DigisatServer.Application.Main.Dto.Compras.Cotacoes.ItemCotacaoDto, class '<>f__AnonymousType1`9'<string, string, string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal, string, string, string, class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.List`1<class '<>f__AnonymousType2`3'<string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal>>>>(class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1<!!0>, class [mscorlib]System.Func`2<!!0, !!1>) /* 2B0000A3 */
		IL_0074: call class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.List`1<!!0> [System.Core]System.Linq.Enumerable::ToList<class '<>f__AnonymousType1`9'<string, string, string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal, string, string, string, class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.List`1<class '<>f__AnonymousType2`3'<string, string, valuetype [mscorlib]System.Decimal>>>>(class [mscorlib]System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1<!!0>) /* 2B0000A4 */
